# Email one-time code and magic-link sign-in (AUTH-06).
title-email_code = Check your email
title-magic_link = Continue signing in
email_code-request_toggle = Sign in with email
email_code-request = Email me a way to sign in
email_code-request_hint = We email you a sign-in code or link.
email_code-sent = If an account exists for that address, we sent a sign-in email to it. It expires in 10 minutes.
email_code-code_hint = Enter the 6-digit code from the email.
email_code-link_hint = Open the sign-in link in the email, in this browser, to finish signing in.
email_code-submit = Sign in
email_code-resend = Send a new email
email_code-other_way = Use another way to sign in
email_code-invalid = That code is not right. Check the email and try again.
email_code-expired = That code has expired. Send a new email.
email_code-invalidated = That code can no longer be used. Send a new email.
email_code-too_many_sends = Too many sign-in emails were sent for this sign-in. Start again from the sign-in page.
email_code-link_explain = Press the button to finish signing in.
email_code-link_continue = Continue signing in
email_code-link_invalid = This sign-in link can no longer be used. Request a new sign-in email from the sign-in page.
email_code-other_browser = Open the link in the browser where you started signing in, or type the code from the email there.
# The magic-link page opened without the sign-in's browser cookie (plan 07.1-14, U-M8).
email_code-link_check_browser = This link works only in the browser where you started signing in. If that is this browser, continue below.
email_code-link_wrong_browser = This link was opened in a different browser from the one where you started signing in, so it cannot sign you in here. Open it in that browser instead.
email_code-link_code_anywhere = You can also type the code from the same email on the sign-in page where you started. The code works whichever device you read the email on.
email_code-start_again = Start signing in again here
